{
  "id": "poem-001",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">它在山间伫立以及等待</span><span class=\"poem-line\">全然地，长成它会长成的样子</span><span class=\"poem-line\">甚至无神论者也愿意称他们为药神。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">如果世界有倒影</span><span class=\"poem-line\">倒影成为了天上星</span><span class=\"poem-line\">在伫立的林间入梦，我看见的是星河。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">本草是繁星，还是繁星是本草？</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/001.webp\" data-caption=\"《生长》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《生长》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/001.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《生长》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《生长》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 1 页</p>"
}
